---
// TestCard.astro: hero visual for /security. The one test result the whole
// page leans on, drawn as a card on the navy ground. Not a log, not a screenshot.
---
<figure class="tc">
  <figcaption class="tc__bar mono"><span>Test on file</span><span>6 Oct 2026</span></figcaption>
  <div class="tc__body">
    <svg class="tc__ico" viewBox="-24 -24 48 48" width="56" height="56" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false">
      <path d="M-18 -4a26 26 0 0 1 36 0M-12 3a17 17 0 0 1 24 0M-6 10a8 8 0 0 1 12 0" />
      <circle cx="0" cy="15" r="1.4" />
      <path d="M-18 -18L18 18" class="tc__slash" />
    </svg>
    <p class="tc__k mono">Cold start · Wi-Fi off</p>
    <p class="tc__n">0</p>
    <p class="tc__l">application requests left the machine.</p>
    <p class="tc__f">Measured by Kriseva on its own machine. It is our test, not a third-party audit. Ask us to run it in your room.</p>
  </div>
  <span class="stamp tc__stamp">Tested</span>
</figure>

<style>
  .tc {
    position: relative;
    max-width: 26rem;
    margin-inline: auto;
    border: 1px solid var(--line-navy);
    border-radius: var(--radius);
    background: rgb(255 255 255 / 4%);
  }

  .tc__bar {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 1rem;
    padding: 0.6rem 1.1rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line-navy);
    font-size: 0.6875rem;
    color: var(--brass-light);
  }

  .tc__body {
    display: grid;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    justify-items: start;
    padding: 1.4rem 1.4rem 1.6rem;
  }

  .tc__ico {
    fill: none;
    stroke: var(--brass-light);
    stroke-width: 2;
    stroke-linecap: round;
  }

  .tc__ico circle {
    fill: var(--brass-light);
    stroke: none;
  }

  .tc__slash {
    stroke: var(--on-navy);
  }

  .tc__k {
    margin-top: 0.5rem;
    color: var(--on-navy-2);
  }

  .tc__n {
    font-family: var(--f-serif);
    font-weight: 300;
    font-size: clamp(5rem, 4rem + 4vw, 7.5rem);
    line-height: 0.95;
    color: var(--brass-light);
  }

  .tc__l {
    font-family: var(--f-serif);
    font-size: 1.3rem;
    line-height: 1.25;
    color: var(--on-navy);
  }

  .tc__f {
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    padding-top: 0.85rem;
    border-top: 1px dashed var(--line-navy);
    font-size: var(--t-small);
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--on-navy-2);
  }

  .tc__stamp {
    position: absolute;
    right: 1.1rem;
    top: 3.4rem;
    transform: rotate(6deg);
  }
</style>
